          "worked": "$a=\\frac{4}{2}=2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+4x+3&=x^2+4x+2^2-2^2+3\\\\&=(x+2)^2-1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p25-q1-e",
